						],
						"pointId": 6254
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740300401,
					"content": "Looking good. If we weren't in a place like this, I would have hired you as my assistants.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300402,
					"content": "This is too easy. By the way, what does this device do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300403,
					"content": "There was a rift that connected to the outside, and it had to be watched. Now we can just seal the passage with this device and save manpower.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300404,
					"content": "This is nothing new to the Fontaine Research Institute, anyway. But since I have plenty of time, I modified it a little.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300405,
					"content": "What you're seeing now isn't even its final form, which was actually deployed at the Geode Mine Shaft... Ahem, I think I spoke too much. Just pretend you didn't hear anything.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300406,
						740300408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300406,
					"content": "So, there are exits in the Geode Mine Shaft.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740300407,
					"content": "Right, you're a smart one. But if you were smarter, you would have kept that to yourself and not blurted it out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300411,
					"content": "Anyway, problem solved. Galvana no longer needs to come down too often, and I can take a break.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300412,
					"content": "...Ah, yes. I almost forgot about your compensation. Thanks for the help!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300408,
					"content": "Is the final version more powerful?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740300409,
					"content": "Of course! There are other components... Wait, why do you want to know?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				},
				{
					"id": 740300410,
					"content": "If you want to know the full extent of it, you can give it a try yourself. But if you're caught, don't say I put you up to it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740300411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clynes"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}